{{also|silber}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|silber}}, from {{inh|de|goh|silbar}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*silubrą}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|zilver}}, {{cog|en|silver}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈzɪlbɐ/|lang=de}}
* {{hyphenation|Sil|ber|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-Silber.ogg|Audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n||-}}

# [[silver]] (chemical element, Ag)
#: Bronze, Silber und Gold hab ich nie gewollt - I never wanted bronze, silver and gold (medals) 
# {{lb|de|heraldry}} [[argent]]

